      "text_sha256": "8b4127abcbac75f866bb785e51431ba9862541c609d0dee580ee7a3e16645c1d",
      "excerpt_preview": "Vishvamitra curses Rambha, the celestial wench, knowing that she arrived at the behest of Indra to cause  hindrance to his ascesis. But later feels ashamed to loose his tongue and then he is determined to undertake  another round of ascesis",
      "excerpt_truncated": true,
      "screen_only": true
    },
    {
